# GD-1 (round 19): L §2.2's reserved words drop `regime` and its clause words drop `export`, so both are ids: an input
# named regime and one named export load and are read (their rows, stated outright).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input regime: num
input export: num
def r: num = regime

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  regime = 2
  export = 3

ask q: r, export
=== expect
q: (2, 3)
  cut 2026-12-31
